api
	External API clients (Overpass API and MapLibre stylesheets).
common
	Shared global types and models.
config
	Configuration defaults, user-facing overrides, and profile schemas.
events
	Domain models and types for map events, incidents, and edge blockages.
graph
	OSM Overpass JSON data parsing and graph construction.
inspector
	On-demand evaluator and GeoJSON builders for intersection details.
landmarks
	Domain models, validation, and spatial search for favorite places and ALT landmarks.
navigation
	Real-time navigation engine and position providers.
router
	Dijkstra pathfinding and dynamic routing cost algorithms.
rules
	Osm matching, bike profiles configuration, and rule speed/delay resolver.
rendering
	Pure functions, types, and theme definitions for unified path rendering.
storage
	Local browser storage persistence adapters.
wasm
	WebAssembly module bindings and initialization helpers for compiled Rust routing engine.
